    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class building a sequence of capped/floored CPI coupons. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Also allowing for the inflated notional at the end... especially if there is only one date in the schedule. If a fixedRate is zero you get a <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_fixed_rate_coupon" kindref="compound">FixedRateCoupon</ref>, otherwise you get a ZeroInflationCoupon.</para><para>payoff is: spread + fixedRate x index </para>    </detaileddescription>
